{"title":"Service sector jobs for the future — bonding and friend-making","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/923373935/0/marginalrevolution~Service-sector-jobs-for-the-future-bonding-and-friendmaking.html","date":1755412630000,"content":"<blockquote><p>At Camp Social, creating chemistry is everything: campers are divided by age, which range from 20s to 60s, into bunks of eight to 10. Each is staffed with a trained counselor who serves as a camp concierge and bonding facilitator—they are even tasked with coming up with a bunk cheer. During the day, campers create their own schedules from a buffet of traditional activities including boating, archery, ropes course, bracelet making, waterfront, tie-dye and tennis. But there are adult embellishments too: paint-and-sip and a mixology class are on the schedule.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Not for me, but <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/style/adult-sleepaway-camp-social-getaway-98e47886\" target=\"_blank\">the article</a> claims these methods are effective.  Via <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/mikerosenwald\" target=\"_blank\">Michael Rosenwald</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/more-service-sector-jobs-for-the-future-bonding-and-friend-making.html\">Service sector jobs for the future — bonding and friend-making</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/923373935/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/923373935/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/923373935/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" s